The shared MenuRow now accepts an icon. Icons use the existing palette and
occupy the reserved space while preserving the original label indentation.
Labels can wrap on narrow screens. Existing actions and pending-feature
behavior are unchanged. Debug APK build passed.

2. HOME NAVIGATION FIX

Commit: 63d9984 - Return Home navigation directly to dashboard

Reported behavior: after opening History from Home through View all, tapping
the Home navigation item could restore History instead of the dashboard.

Cause: the shared root-navigation handler used restoreState for Home and could
restore a saved nested stack associated with the dashboard destination.

Fix: Home now returns directly to the existing dashboard root. If that root
is absent, navigation creates a dashboard destination without restoring a
saved nested stack. Tapping Home while already on the dashboard is a no-op.

Extended the existing UI behavior smoke check to cover:
  - Home > View all > History > Home.
  - Home > History tab > Home.

The targeted behavior check and debug APK build passed. The total regression
suite remains ten focused checks. No layout tests, screenshot baselines, or
device-size matrix tests were added.

